          <y:NodeLabel textColor="#14171F" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="11" alignment="center" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" autoSizePolicy="content">FE &#8212; Frontend&#10;Peran: antarmuka pengguna,&#10;akses via browser</y:NodeLabel>
